### Successful transfer — alice sends 400 to bob
GRPC {{host}}:{{port}}/bank.v1.BankService/Transfer

{
  "from": {
    "id": "alice"
  },
  "to": {
    "id": "bob"
  },
  "amount": 400,
  "client_tx_id": {
    "id": "tx-1"
  }
}

### Retry the same transfer — same client_tx_id, expects COMMITTED_OK (idempotent)
GRPC {{host}}:{{port}}/bank.v1.BankService/Transfer

{
  "from": {
    "id": "alice"
  },
  "to": {
    "id": "bob"
  },
  "amount": 400,
  "client_tx_id": {
    "id": "tx-1"
  }
}

### Insufficient funds — alice tries to send more than her balance
GRPC {{host}}:{{port}}/bank.v1.BankService/Transfer

{
  "from": {
    "id": "alice"
  },
  "to": {
    "id": "bob"
  },
  "amount": 999999,
  "client_tx_id": {
    "id": "tx-2"
  }
}

### Invalid account — destination does not exist
GRPC {{host}}:{{port}}/bank.v1.BankService/Transfer

{
  "from": {
    "id": "alice"
  },
  "to": {
    "id": "nobody"
  },
  "amount": 100,
  "client_tx_id": {
    "id": "tx-3"
  }
}

